                    <a class="nav-link" href="/WindowsForms/ToolboxMastery/Controls/MenuStrip">MenuStrip</a>
                    <a class="nav-link" href="/WindowsForms/ToolboxMastery/Controls/NotifyIcon">NotifyIcon</a>
